{
  "sourceLanguage": "es",
  "strings": {
    "%@ h · %lld ciclos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ h · %2$lld cycles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld ciclos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld cycles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld ciclos = %@ h de sueño. 5 es lo recomendado.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld cycles = %2$@ h of sleep. 5 is recommended."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 ciclos y como nuevo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 cycles and good as new"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 min más…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 more min…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Ajustes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alarma": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alarm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Consejos de higiene del sueño": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep hygiene tips"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cyclock no tiene permiso para crear alarmas. Actívalo en Ajustes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cyclock is not allowed to create alarms. Turn it on in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Despertar en pleno sueño profundo causa 'inercia del sueño': desorientación, dolor de cabeza y más fatiga.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waking in the middle of deep sleep causes 'sleep inertia': disorientation, headache and more fatigue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Estudio de la NASA: mejora el rendimiento un 34% y la alerta mental un 54%.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NASA study: improves performance by 34% and alertness by 54%."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Estudios de la NASA con pilotos mostraron que 26 min mejora la alerta (+54%) y el rendimiento (+34%) justo antes de entrar en sueño profundo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NASA studies with pilots showed that 26 min improves alertness (+54%) and performance (+34%) right before entering deep sleep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evita pantallas 1 h antes de dormir, mantén la habitación fresca (~18°C) y corta la cafeína 6 h antes de acostarte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avoid screens 1 h before bed, keep your room cool (~18°C / 65°F) and cut caffeine 6 h before bedtime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fin de la siesta": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nap is over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gato": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hora de despertar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wake-up time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hora de dormir": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedtime"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sueño ideal. Cumple con la recomendación general de descanso saludable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ideal sleep. Meets the general recommendation for healthy rest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sueño insuficiente. Es probable que tengas somnolencia durante el día.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insufficient sleep. You'll likely feel drowsy during the day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sueño ligero. Recarga sin entrar en sueño profundo, así evitas el atontamiento.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light sleep. Recharges without entering deep sleep, so you avoid grogginess."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sueño mínimo. Suficiente para funcionar, pero podrías sentir fatiga acumulada.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Minimum sleep. Enough to function, but you may feel accumulated fatigue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sueño óptimo. Te despertarás renovado y con máxima alerta mental.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optimal sleep. You'll wake up refreshed and fully alert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tu cerebro recorre 4 fases de sueño cada ~90 minutos. Despertar al final de un ciclo se siente natural y renovado.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your brain goes through 4 sleep stages every ~90 minutes. Waking at the end of a cycle feels natural and refreshing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un ciclo entero con sueño REM. Consolida la memoria y la creatividad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One full cycle including REM sleep. Consolidates memory and creativity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
